*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CLM0008
*> PURPOSE : INSURANCE CLAIMS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-07-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-06 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 170
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CLMNIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0008.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY CLM0008C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==IN==.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 SU-IND             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 SU-REFERRED VALUE 'Y'.
    05 C-DN               PIC X VALUE 'A'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM CHECK-POLICE-RPT
    PERFORM FREQUENT-CLAIMANT
    DISPLAY "SU-IND=" SU-IND
    DISPLAY "C-DN=" C-DN
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-POLICE-RPT.
    *> AUTO CLAIM WITHOUT POLICE REPORT
    IF L-AUTO AND P-IS-N AND IN-WS-CLAM > 5000
        SET SU-REFERRED TO TRUE
        MOVE 'I' TO C-DN
    END-IF.
FREQUENT-CLAIMANT.
    *> FREQUENT CLAIMANT
    IF IN-PC-CT NOT < 4
        SET SU-REFERRED TO TRUE
    END-IF.
